  "description": "iManage Work document provider for OfficeAgent.NET, which lets AI agents edit existing Word, PowerPoint and Excel files and fill templates: registers, opens, versions, and creates documents in iManage Work libraries through the iManage Work REST API v2. Agents address documents by an opaque (connectionId, documentId); the provider never exposes library ids, document numbers, server URLs, or credentials to the model.",
